# tools/d/dahl_j11_council_sky_witness.rish — Season 3 Journey 11 (Council skies), Rung 1.
#
# Season 3, Commons — a community shapes its own deliberation. Journey 10 (Membership) drew quorum at a
# threshold a caller chooses, over a flat roster. Journey 11 draws the load-bearing move the
# loadable-topologies brief named: a council does not merely pick a threshold, it loads a whole shape — a
# sky — the way a console loads a game, and the sky's own odd fractal gives the council its tie-free
# quorum and its roles. pond/apps/council_sky.rye fixes the crux — an odd sky gives a tie-free quorum and
# a complete triad. A Council loads a Sky (comlink/topology.rye) and seats a body at one of the sky's own
# fractal levels; the council sky's four counts are 3 * 9 * 15 * 27, every one odd, so the majority quorum
# can never tie. The compass sky's even d60 refuses (EvenCouncil). Each seat wears a modality role
# (initiator, sustainer, adapter) by seat mod 3, so a triad is complete. A non-seat vote (NotSeated), a
# doubled ballot (AlreadyVoted), and a size the sky does not name (NotAFractalLevel) each refuse. Pure
# state machine — no signing yet (r2 binds each vote to a settled Kumara identity). Facts only; no
# network, no key, no real identity (serve reaches the custody gate); demo seats only.
#
# Run from the repository root:
#   rishi/bin/rishi run tools/d/dahl_j11_council_sky_witness.rish

say "dahl-j11r1: Language EN — a community loads a sky, and the sky's odd fractal gives a tie-free majority quorum and a complete triad of modality roles."
say "dahl-j11r1: Lens TAME — the odd fractal 3-9-15-27 all seat; the even d60 refuses EvenCouncil; a non-seat, a doubled ballot, and an unnamed size each refuse."

let zig = "vendor/zig-toolchain/zig"

let bin = "pond/bin/council-sky"
let build = run ["sh" "-c" "mkdir -p pond/bin && env RYE_ZIG=${zig} rye/bin/rye build pond/apps/council_sky.rye -femit-bin=${bin}"]
assert build.ok else "dahl-j11r1: council_sky build failed"

let selftest = run ["sh" "-c" "${bin} selftest 2>&1"]
assert selftest.ok else "dahl-j11r1: council_sky selftest exited non-zero"
assert selftest.out contains "GREEN" else "dahl-j11r1: selftest did not speak GREEN"
assert selftest.out contains "odd fractal 3-9-15-27 all seated" else "dahl-j11r1: odd-fractal crux missing"
assert selftest.out contains "a majority of an odd body never ties" else "dahl-j11r1: tie-free crux missing"
assert selftest.out contains "a body of complete triads" else "dahl-j11r1: modality-triad crux missing"
assert selftest.out contains "refused EvenCouncil" else "dahl-j11r1: even-council refusal missing"
assert selftest.out contains "one hand can never fake a majority" else "dahl-j11r1: lone-hand crux missing"

say "GREEN: dahl-j11r1 — council_sky loads a sky and the odd fractal gives a tie-free majority quorum and complete modality roles; the even d60 refuses."
